0c32aEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_Felogyrsfireworks_CitizenSueing</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Felogyrsfireworks_CitizenSueing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Felogyrsfireworks_CitizenSueing\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">50e0d3e3-19e3-4920-aa0d-dfd7ed4ddfe7</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:50e0d3e3-19e3-4920-aa0d-dfd7ed4ddfe7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:50e0d3e3-19e3-4920-aa0d-dfd7ed4ddfe7\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the mailbox of <a href=\"/wiki/Felogyr%27s_Fireworks\" title=\"Felogyr's Fireworks\">Felogyr's Fireworks</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;12&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-122</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>I hope you're proud of yourself Mr. Sonshal. I haven't been able to hold a pen in a tenday thanks to the burns I got from your blasted fireworks! Expect a visit from my lawyers. I'll be seeking FULL compensation.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715104034\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1351/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23227/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5227/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936106/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.674      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   37.674      1 -total\n 49.24%   18.552      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.18%   16.269     15 Template:Trim\n 23.42%    8.824      2 Template:Uid\n 16.49%    6.211      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.01%    5.280      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.48%    3.947      1 Template:Notes\n  9.73%    3.666      1 Template:Icon_link\n  9.28%    3.497      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35142-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715104034 and revision id 396959. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}